    {
      "name": "Measurements Over Testimony",
      "type": "feature",
      "_id": "gwBesEddaMarIt02",
      "img": "icons/skills/trades/academics-investigation-study-blue.webp",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>Given an hour, her instruments and access to the installed work, Edda can say whether a ward matches the work it was certified for, and roughly how it is failing. She has an edge on Reason tests to reproduce a known ward failure or to spot a component that has been swapped for an identical-looking part that will pass.</p><p>She will not state a conclusion she has not measured, and she will say so out loud rather than guess for a client.</p>",
          "director": ""
        },
        "source": {
          "book": "Ghostwire Core Rulebook",
          "page": "25-opposition",
          "license": "Draw Steel Creator License"
        },
        "_dsid": "measurements-over-testimony",
        "advancements": {},
        "prerequisites": {
          "value": "",
          "dsid": [],
          "level": null
        }
      },
      "effects": [],
      "folder": null,
      "sort": 10,
      "ownership": {
        "default": 0
      },
      "flags": {},
      "_key": "!actors.items!gwBesEddaMarr000.gwBesEddaMarIt02"
    },
    {
      "name": "The Institution That Trained Her",
      "type": "feature",
      "_id": "gwBesEddaMarIt03",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-embossed-clasp-gold-brown.webp",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p><strong>Director-facing.</strong> Any negotiation that asks Edda to publish against the Collegium itself, name a sponsor, or hand an inspection ledger to someone who will use it for mass eviction loses 1 Patience immediately and cannot reach its final tier on the first attempt.</p><p>Show her the residents' side of the closure order — who sleeps where tonight — and the pitfall lifts for that scene.</p>",
          "director": ""
        },
        "source": {
          "book": "Ghostwire Core Rulebook",
          "page": "25-opposition",
          "license": "Draw Steel Creator License"
        },
        "_dsid": "the-institution-that-trained-her",
